  "title": "Lemon Whippersnappers",
  "description": "Lemon whippersnappers are little balls of lemon-flavored dough that are rolled in powdered sugar. They bake up just like chocolate crinkle cookies!",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer"
  ],
